WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.821
This query creates normalized email and name keys It
groups rows

00:00:05.847 --> 00:00:11.632
by those normalized values Groups with more than one
row become duplicate

00:00:11.658 --> 00:00:17.495
candidates ARRAY_AGG shows the source IDs in each
group

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:25.015
This is detection only It does not yet say which
source row is better
